# Walkthrough - Cross-Platform Reminders (Android & Desktop)

We have successfully implemented a unified, cross-platform **Medication & Vital Sign Reminder System** for CardioGuard, built to work reliably on both **Android Native (Capacitor)** and **Desktop/Browser**.

---

## 🛠️ Changes Implemented

### 1. Unified Notification Service
* **[src/services/notificationService.ts](file:///c:/Users/adeel/OneDrive/Desktop/CARDIOGUARD/src/services/notificationService.ts)**
  * Created a singleton service `notificationService` wrapping `@capacitor/local-notifications` for native mobile alarms and standard Web Notification API / Web Audio chime for Desktop browsers.
  * Added time string parser (`parseTimeToHourMinute`) supporting 12-hour AM/PM formats, 24-hour formats, and descriptive times (`"Morning"`, `"Night"`).
  * Implemented high-importance Android notification channels (`cardioguard_med_alarms`) with custom ringtones, lock screen visibility, and vibration.
  * Added lock-screen interactive action buttons (*"Mark as Taken 💊"* and *"Snooze 15m ⏰"*).
  * Added low-pill refill stock alert triggers (`remainingPills <= 5`).
  * Added instant test notification simulator method (`triggerTestNotification`).

### 2. Model & Type Extensions
* **[src/types.ts](file:///c:/Users/adeel/OneDrive/Desktop/CARDIOGUARD/src/types.ts)**
  * Extended `Medication` interface with optional `reminderEnabled?: boolean` and `notificationId?: number` fields.

### 3. Medication Manager UI & Controls
* **[src/components/MedicationManager.tsx](file:///c:/Users/adeel/OneDrive/Desktop/CARDIOGUARD/src/components/MedicationManager.tsx)**
  * Added a **"Daily Reminder Alarm" toggle** inside the *Add Medication* modal.
  * Added a quick **Bell / BellOff button** on each medication card allowing patients to mute or activate alarms per medication.
  * Integrated permission request triggers on initial alarm configuration.

### 4. Desktop Dashboard Integration
* **[src/components/DesktopDashboard.tsx](file:///c:/Users/adeel/OneDrive/Desktop/CARDIOGUARD/src/components/DesktopDashboard.tsx)**
  * Passed down `onToggleReminder` handler to `<MedicationManager />`.

### 5. Settings Modal Controls & Test Button
* **[src/components/SettingsModal.tsx](file:///c:/Users/adeel/OneDrive/Desktop/CARDIOGUARD/src/components/SettingsModal.tsx)**
  * Added an instant **"Send Test Notification"** button under Notification Permissions to allow instant lock screen & desktop notification testing.

### 6. App Root Sync & Action Listener
* **[src/App.tsx](file:///c:/Users/adeel/OneDrive/Desktop/CARDIOGUARD/src/App.tsx)**
  * Added initialization for notification channels and lock screen action listeners (`setupNotificationListeners`).
  * Synced medication reminders automatically on add, edit, toggle, and delete operations.

